  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Printed as two column groups stacked on the page, each with three row blocks (本科入學志願者 / 本科入學者 / 本科入學志願者百中本科入學者); joined here into three parts of 32 columns each (年次 + 16 columns of the upper group + 15 of the lower group). Years 昭和 3-7 (年度); label '昭和' expanded, '年度' printed after 3 only.",
   "Rows: 5 per part x 3 parts = 15 rows as printed.",
   "Upper group: one figure per row is printed centred across the 文學 and 語學 columns (e.g. 10,093); it is entered under 文學 and 語學 is left empty — the printed layout does not show which of the two it belongs to (probably a merged 文學語學 figure).",
   "Heading of the sixth lower-group 專門學校 column is read '[?]技' (first character could be 潤/測/調; not legible with confidence).",
   "Part 1, row 昭和 4, 專門學校 — 美術: printed '040' (leading '1,' apparently missing); kept as printed. (The percentage 25.48 in part 3 would correspond to 1,040, not used for the cell.)",
   "Part 3, row 昭和 7, 農業 (實業專門學校): printed '31 96' without the decimal point; kept as printed.",
   "Percent block re-computed as 入學者/志願者x100: all agree within 0.06 except five cells, re-read and kept as printed: 昭和 3 專門學校 農業 (printed 41.16, computed 44.16); 昭和 4 美術 (志願者 printed '040'); 昭和 6 美術 (1,961 and 275 vs 28.62, computed 14.02); 昭和 6 大學 帝國大學 (10,036 and 6,131 vs 59.18, computed 61.09); 昭和 7 實科高等女學校 (9,983 and 8,898 vs 86.13, computed 89.13). Printed inconsistencies in the source, not corrected.",
   "No unreadable figures other than the heading noted."
  ],
